        "height": 600,
        "content": "## 📋 Risk Register Update & High-Risk Alerts\nThe parsed risk result is written to Google Sheets. If the rating is High or Critical, a Slack alert goes to the security team channel and a summary email is sent to the security inbox — giving the team immediate visibility on the riskiest vendors."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
